  /* ───────── Report CSS ko website par zaroor lagana ─────────
     Report JS apni CSS <style id="ucm-..."> tag bana kar head mein daalti hai.
     Is website par (Frappe Cloud) script se banaye gaye <style> tag ignore ho
     rahe hain (Content Security Policy) — isliye har aise tag ki CSS ko
     browser ke CSSOM (adoptedStyleSheets) se bhi laga dete hain, jise policy
